{"study_accession":"PRJNA1216651","secondary_study_accession":"SRP560466","title":"Endogenous retroviruses promote aberrant T cell differentiation in systemic lupus erythematosus via the RIG-I pathway [whole transcriptomics]","description":"The dysregulated differentiation of T lymphocytes play an important role in systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE). However, the underlying mechanism remains unclear. Here, we screened and identified many overexpressed HERVs in CD4+ T cells from SLE patients by whole transcriptome resequencing and found that some HERVs formed dsRNAs to induce the activation of the RIG-I signaling pathway. And our findings reveal the roles and mechanism of HERVs and RIG-I in regulating the aberrant differentiation of T cells in SLE patients. Overall design: mRNA prifules of CD4+T cells of SLE and HCs","pubmed":"40992212","geo_series":"","n_samples":10,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN46439639","study_accession":"PRJNA1216651","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"HC5","description":"HC5","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8762608","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2025-12-21","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["tissue","PBMC"],["cell_type","CD4+T cells"],["treatment","HC"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR32156868","experiment_accession":"SRX27502419","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":47352142,"base_count":14205642600,"first_public":"2025-12-21","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM8762608: HC5 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN46439640","study_accession":"PRJNA1216651","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"HC4","description":"HC4","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8762607","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2025-12-21","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["tissue","PBMC"],["cell_type","CD4+T cells"],[